# This file must sit at the build context root, which for the backend image is the repository
# root. Excluding bin/ and obj/ is not just about image size: copying the host's obj/ into the
# build would overwrite the restore performed inside the container with an asset file that
# points at host paths, and `dotnet publish --no-restore` then fails on missing packages.
**/bin/
**/obj/

**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
.git/
.github/
.direnv/
/result

deploy/
scripts/
tests/
RedePanda-kafka-docker/
src/RedePanda.ChatClient/
src/RedePanda.Frontend/

*.md
*.png
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.envrc
flake.nix
flake.lock
